Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.07,0:00:32.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操！\N{\fs50}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.64,0:01:05.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是我啊！\N{\fs50}It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.94,0:01:10.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有人吗？\N{\fs50}Anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.56,0:03:07.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,真见鬼\N{\fs50}Oh shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.16,0:03:31.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fs50}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.42,0:03:33.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fs50}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.10,0:03:51.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好样的 我就知道\N{\fs50}Yeah, you tell 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.10,0:03:55.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你他妈真是个好样的 艾莉\N{\fs50}You fuckin' tell 'em, Ellie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.95,0:04:03.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.03,0:04:09.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fs50}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.37,0:04:12.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你是个顽强的小家伙\N{\fs50}You're so tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.17,0:04:16.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,妈妈在这儿 没事的\N{\fs50}I got you. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.88,0:04:20.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,对 没事的\N{\fs50}Yeah, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.03,0:06:47.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,安娜？\N{\fs50}Anna?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.91,0:06:57.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,抱紧我\N{\fs50}♪ Hold me ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.00,0:06:58.50,Note_top_TLOU-歌词,,0,0,0,,《The Sun Always Shines on T.V.》，原唱a-ha，发表于1985年
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.41,0:07:01.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,贴近你心窝\N{\fs50}♪ Close to your heart ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.08,0:07:03.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,触摸我\N{\fs50}♪ Touch me ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.05,0:07:09.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,将爱给予我\N{\fs50}♪ Give all your love to me ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.69,0:07:26.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,老天啊\N{\fs50}Oh God.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.78,0:07:30.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这不是你的错\N{\fs50}It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.44,0:07:32.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们在离开隔离区时遇上了麻烦\N{\fs50}We were delayed getting out of the zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.03,0:07:34.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她饿坏了\N{\fs50}She's hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.99,0:07:38.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她得喝奶 但我\N{\fs50}She needs to be fed, and I
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.87,0:07:41.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不打算喂她\N{\fs50}I didn't wanna nurse her.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.67,0:07:50.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我在被咬之前就剪断了脐带\N{\fs50}I cut it before I was bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.84,0:07:55.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是之前\N{\fs50}Before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.35,0:08:02.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我希望你把她带去波士顿\N{\fs50}I want you to take her with you to Boston
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.14,0:08:05.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,找人把她带大 确保她安全\N{\fs50}find someone to bring her up and make sure that she's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.40,0:08:07.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我没法做到\N{\fs50}I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.06,0:08:08.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还有这个 你交给她\N{\fs50}And I want you to give her this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.07,0:08:12.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,安娜\N{\fs50}Anna.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.28,0:08:16.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她的名字是艾莉\N{\fs50}Her name is Ellie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.95,0:08:20.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我没法\N{\fs50}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.41,0:08:22.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们彼此认识多久了？\N{\fs50}How long have we known each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.88,0:08:31.21,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,一生\N{\fs50}Our whole lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.92,0:08:36.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你现在把她接过去\N{\fs50}So you pick her up right now
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.60,0:08:39.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,然后杀了我\N{\fs50}and then you kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.54,0:09:10.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我下不了这个手\N{\fs50}I can't kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.92,0:09:14.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,求求你 求求你 求求你\N{\fs50}Please, please, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.76,0:09:15.88,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我求求你了！\N{\fs50}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.55,0:09:21.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,玛琳！\N{\fs50}Marlene!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.02,0:09:26.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,接着她\N{\fs50}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.52,0:09:30.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,托着她的头 接好了\N{\fs50}Hold her head. There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.69,0:09:33.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还有这个\N{\fs50}Take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.37,0:09:44.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,给她蒙上耳朵\N{\fs50}Cover her ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.21,0:10:33.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,艾莉\N{\fs50}Ellie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.46,0:10:36.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,艾莉\N{\fs50}Ellie.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.72,0:10:40.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,艾莉！\N{\fs50}Ellie!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.55,0:10:43.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你听见我说话了吗？\N{\fs50}D'ya hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.35,0:10:46.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没有 什么事？\N{\fs50}No. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.60,0:10:48.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我在那边发现了好东西\N{\fs50}Well, I found this in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.85,0:10:50.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,牛肉意面 主厨博亚迪的\N{\fs50}Beefaroni. Chef Boyardee.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.23,0:10:52.56,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,哇 真好\N{\fs50}Oh, cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.90,0:10:58.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你之前玩过这个吗？\N{\fs50}And have you ever played this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.86,0:11:00.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,叫Boggle 拼字游戏\N{\fs50}Boggle? It's a word game.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.16,0:11:06.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,如果你想在某方面赢过我 那就是这玩意儿了\N{\fs50}Well, if you wanna beat me at somethin', it would be this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.75,0:11:12.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯 行吧\N{\fs50}Well, all right then.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.21,0:11:14.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,越来越近了\N{\fs50}We're gettin' close.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.38,0:11:16.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那个方向有医院\N{\fs50}Hospital that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.75,0:11:18.55,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,或许正是我们要找的\N{\fs50}May be the one we're lookin' for.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.05,0:11:20.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fs50}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.61,0:11:38.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,帮我拿一下？\N{\fs50}Take this for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.20,0:11:44.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fs50}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.83,0:11:54.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那边的房车里有把吉他\N{\fs50}They had a guitar in that RV.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.42,0:11:58.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,早就稀烂了 不过这让我觉得\N{\fs50}It was all smashed up but got me thinkin'
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.38,0:11:59.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,也许我该搞一把\N{\fs50}maybe I should find one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.76,0:12:02.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,已经很久没弹过了\N{\fs50}I haven't played in forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.05,0:12:04.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,其实吧 我在想 也许可以教教你\N{\fs50}In fact, I was thinkin' maybe I could teach you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.93,0:12:06.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我敢说 你肯定是把好手\N{\fs50}I bet you'd be great at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.93,0:12:10.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你想不想学吉他？\N{\fs50}Do you wanna learn how to play guitar?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.81,0:12:16.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,艾莉？\N{\fs50}Ellie?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.31,0:12:18.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,啊 啊好\N{\fs50}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.99,0:12:23.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那就太好了\N{\fs50}That'd be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.35,0:12:51.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好了 我跟你说说我的计划——\N{\fs50}Okay, so this is what I'm thinking--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.81,0:12:53.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,穿过那边的大楼 绕过障碍物\N{\fs50}Cut through that building to get around that stuff,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.68,0:12:56.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,找幢高楼 爬上去 观察一下\N{\fs50}find the skyscraper, go up and look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.44,0:13:00.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,其实我打算把眼前那堆砖石炸飞\N{\fs50}Actually, this time I was thinkin' we blast
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.90,0:13:02.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,开条路出来\N{\fs50}our way through that rubble.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.07,0:13:04.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我在先前那辆房车里发现了炸药\N{\fs50}I found some dynamite in that RV back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.53,0:13:05.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,真的假的？\N{\fs50}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.78,0:13:08.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,假的 我们还是要穿过那栋楼\N{\fs50}No, so we're gonna cut through that building,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.57,0:13:11.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,找幢高楼 爬上去 观察一下\N{\fs50}find a skyscraper, go up and look around.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.20,0:13:13.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我刚刚把你骗住了 对不？\N{\fs50}But I had you goin', didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.76,0:13:33.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,瞧这地方\N{\fs50}Look at this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.39,0:13:36.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,真是走背字啊\N{\fs50}Talk about bad luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.06,0:13:38.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,军队到处投弹\N{\fs50}Military drops bombs,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.85,0:13:42.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这栋建筑他们想炸掉 但就是炸不中\N{\fs50}not one of them hits the building you're trying to demolish.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.40,0:13:48.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没法再往上走了\N{\fs50}No way up.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.76,0:14:11.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我托你上去 你把梯子放下来\N{\fs50}I get you up there, you can drop that ladder down,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.22,0:14:13.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,也许这路我们能走得通\N{\fs50}maybe we go through that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.81,0:14:15.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,快过来 我把你托上去\N{\fs50}Come on. I'll give you a boost.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.74,0:14:32.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你还好吧？\N{\fs50}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.30,0:14:33.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯 我挺好\N{\fs50}Yeah, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.91,0:14:36.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你今天也太安静了\N{\fs50}It's just you kinda seem extra quiet today, so.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.83,0:14:40.21,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 很抱歉 - 没事 没事\N{\fs50}- I'm sorry. - No, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.33,0:14:42.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你听到我刚刚说——\N{\fs50}Did you hear what I--
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.27,0:14:43.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,听到了 托上去\N{\fs50}Yeah, boost.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.50,0:14:44.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,来了\N{\fs50}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.39,0:14:58.52,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,一 二 上\N{\fs50}One, two, up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.81,0:15:05.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 你上去了吧？ - 上来了\N{\fs50}- Ya got it? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.77,0:15:07.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那好\N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.08,0:15:19.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,哇哦！\N{\fs50}Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.83,0:15:22.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,见鬼了 艾莉！\N{\fs50}God damn it, Ellie!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.96,0:15:23.88,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,操\N{\fs50}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.79,0:15:26.55,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你别乱跑！\N{\fs50}You stay there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.67,0:15:29.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你快来看啊！\N{\fs50}You gotta see this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.38,0:15:30.55,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,艾莉？\N{\fs50}Ellie?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.13,0:15:32.26,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,上来这儿！\N{\fs50}Up here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.14,0:15:34.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 艾莉！ - 动作快点！\N{\fs50}- Ellie! - C'mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.81,0:15:43.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 艾莉！ - 快来！\N{\fs50}- Ellie. - C'mon!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.60,0:15:46.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,等一等 我操了\N{\fs50}Just wait. God damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.93,0:16:14.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,别吓着它\N{\fs50}Don't scare it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.53,0:16:15.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不会的\N{\fs50}I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.35,0:16:21.37,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你在干吗？\N{\fs50}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.66,0:16:22.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,放心好了\N{\fs50}It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.64,0:16:25.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,站到这儿 快点 过来\N{\fs50}Come here, hurry up. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.62,0:16:44.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你好呀\N{\fs50}Hey there.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.89,0:17:01.52,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,真他妈牛逼\N{\fs50}So fucking cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.31,0:17:06.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她要去哪儿？\N{\fs50}Where's she going?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.06,0:17:08.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,快点 快点 快 快跟上！\N{\fs50}Come on, come on, come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.57,0:17:13.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.35,0:17:50.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fs50}So
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.11,0:17:53.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这一切如你所愿吗？\N{\fs50}is it everything ya hoped for?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.40,0:17:56.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好赖参半吧\N{\fs50}It's got its ups and downs,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.70,0:17:58.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但这景色真绝了\N{\fs50}but you can't deny that view.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.33,0:18:10.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,听我说 我不知道医院的确切位置——\N{\fs50}Look, I don't know exactly where this hospital is--
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.38,0:18:12.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没事啊 我们会找到的\N{\fs50}Yeah, we'll find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.46,0:18:14.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,当然 只是——\N{\fs50}Sure. It's just--
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.93,0:18:19.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,或许那里一切都好 但至今为止\N{\fs50}Maybe there's nothin' bad out there, but so far
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.68,0:18:21.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,总会有不好的事情发生\N{\fs50}there's always been somethin' bad out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.89,0:18:23.99,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,可我们还是来了\N{\fs50}We're still here, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.45,0:18:25.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fs50}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.60,0:18:28.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我只是说有风险\N{\fs50}I'm only saying there's risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.40,0:18:32.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没必要非得这么做\N{\fs50}We don't have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.02,0:18:34.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我想让你知道这一点\N{\fs50}I want you to know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.61,0:18:36.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你是什么意思？我们还能怎么做？\N{\fs50}What do you mean? What else are we supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.49,0:18:38.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,什么都不用做 直接回汤米那儿\N{\fs50}Nothin'. We just go back to Tommy's.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.20,0:18:40.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,把这些破事都忘掉\N{\fs50}We forget about the whole damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.20,0:18:45.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,在经历过重重困难后\N{\fs50}After all we've been through
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.41,0:18:48.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我相信我所做的每件事\N{\fs50}everything I've done
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.63,0:18:55.55,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,都不会白白浪费\N{\fs50}it can't be for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.22,0:19:02.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我知道你是好心好意\N{\fs50}I know you mean well.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.30,0:19:05.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,也明白你想要保护我 你一直在保护我\N{\fs50}I know you wanna protect me. You have.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.68,0:19:08.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,当这一切都结束后 我们可以去任何你想去的地方\N{\fs50}And when we're done, we'll go wherever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.39,0:19:12.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,无论是汤米那儿 还是绵羊牧场\N{\fs50}Tommy's, sheep ranch,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.69,0:19:14.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,甚至月球\N{\fs50}the moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.03,0:19:20.15,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我跟着你走 随你去哪儿都成\N{\fs50}I'll follow you anywhere you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.66,0:19:29.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但这件事必须做完\N{\fs50}But there's no halfway with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.08,0:19:33.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,一旦开始 就要做到底\N{\fs50}We finish what we started.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.77,0:20:36.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 这是FEDRA搞的吗？ - 不是他们\N{\fs50}- Was this a FEDRA thing? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.90,0:20:39.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,是军队\N{\fs50}Army.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.28,0:20:44.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,在疫情爆发后的头几天里 到处都是这种地方\N{\fs50}They put these places up all around, the first few days after the outbreak.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.36,0:20:47.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,叫紧急医疗营地\N{\fs50}Emergency medical camps.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.03,0:20:49.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,很显然 都没能维持下去\N{\fs50}Obviously didn't last.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.41,0:20:52.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们曾把我带到这种地方\N{\fs50}They had me in one just like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.06,0:20:53.54,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,和莎拉一起？\N{\fs50}With Sarah?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.54,0:20:55.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她当时已经不在了\N{\fs50}No, she was gone already.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.00,0:20:59.67,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那他们为什么带你过去？\N{\fs50}So what was wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.67,0:21:00.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,因为这疤\N{\fs50}It was for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.73,0:21:02.26,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有人开枪打你 结果没打中\N{\fs50}The guy who shot and missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.76,0:21:04.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我还以为那是挺后面发生的事\N{\fs50}I figured that would've happened later.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.93,0:21:05.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,确实不是\N{\fs50}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.64,0:21:07.72,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,就第二天\N{\fs50}Second day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.72,0:21:09.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,早知道我就让军队的人来给你包扎\N{\fs50}I've gotta hand it to the Army people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.60,0:21:11.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们比我更擅长缝合你身上那种伤口\N{\fs50}They were way better at stitchin' you up than I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.47,0:21:12.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我自己干的\N{\fs50}It was me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.31,0:21:18.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我就是那个开了枪却又射偏的人\N{\fs50}I was the guy who shot and missed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.20,0:21:33.95,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没什么好说的\N{\fs50}There's no story.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.08,0:21:36.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,莎拉死了\N{\fs50}Sarah died,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.96,0:21:39.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我的生活失去了意义\N{\fs50}and I couldn't see the point anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.50,0:21:41.13,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,就这么简单\N{\fs50}Simple as that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.09,0:21:46.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我没觉得害怕 当时已经准备好了\N{\fs50}And I wasn't scared either. I was ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.76,0:21:51.89,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,准备得不能再好了\N{\fs50}I couldn't have been more ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.35,0:21:56.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,可当我——\N{\fs50}When I--
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.06,0:22:01.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,当我\N{\fs50}When I
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.90,0:22:05.44,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,想要扣动扳机时 我却退缩了\N{\fs50}went to pull the trigger, I flinched.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.49,0:22:09.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,至今不知道原因\N{\fs50}Still don't know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.12,0:22:15.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我把这一切告诉你是因为——\N{\fs50}Anyway, the reason I'm telling you all this--
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.08,0:22:17.12,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我明白你为什么把这一切都告诉我\N{\fs50}I know why you're tellin' me all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.71,0:22:20.46,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,也对 我想你明白\N{\fs50}Yeah, I reckon you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.67,0:22:28.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,时间会抚平所有的伤口 或许吧\N{\fs50}So time heals all wounds, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.85,0:22:33.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,并不是时间\N{\fs50}It wasn't time that did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.07,0:22:48.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我真的很高兴\N{\fs50}Well, I'm glad that
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.49,0:22:52.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你之前的尝试没有成功\N{\fs50}that didn't work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.91,0:22:56.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我也这么想\N{\fs50}Me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.38,0:23:05.92,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 我们该走了 - 好啊\N{\fs50}- We should probably get going. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.68,0:23:15.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你知道我现在想听点啥吗？\N{\fs50}You know what I'm in the mood for?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.64,0:23:16.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,听啥？\N{\fs50}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.14,0:23:18.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,烂双关笑话\N{\fs50}Shitty puns.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.57,0:23:29.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“人们开着末日玩笑 就好像不会有明天似的”\N{\fs50}"People are making apocalypse jokes like there's no tomorrow."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.95,0:23:32.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 笑话开早了？ - 不会 挺符合时事的\N{\fs50}- Too soon? - No, it's topical.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.16,0:23:34.32,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这个我喜欢\N{\fs50}I love this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.32,0:23:37.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,月亮上的石头尝起来比地球上的味道好 为什么？\N{\fs50}"Moon rocks taste better than Earth rocks. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.99,0:23:40.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 因为它更有“陨味” - 这也太烂了\N{\fs50}- 'Cause they're meteor." - That's terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.00,0:23:41.00,Note_top_TLOU,,0,0,0,,meteor：陨石；末尾“ə(r)”谐音比较级的音，表示“更……”
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.16,0:23:41.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,去你妈的 这是个好笑话\N{\fs50}Fuck you. That was actually good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.79,0:23:44.08,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 满分10分 我只能给零分 - 行行行\N{\fs50}- That's a zero outta 10. - All right, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.08,0:23:47.09,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“绿葡萄对紫葡萄咋说的？\N{\fs50}"What did the green grape say to the purple grape?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.26,0:23:49.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,呼吸啊 你个笨蛋”\N{\fs50}Breathe, you idiot."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.88,0:23:52.34,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这个笑话值三分吧\N{\fs50}That was a three outta 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.34,0:23:54.18,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 至少得是七分 - 那我打五分吧\N{\fs50}- Seven, minimum. - I'll give it a five.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.18,0:23:56.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 满分10分 五分 - 才五分？\N{\fs50}- Five outta 10. - Five?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.32,0:24:08.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 乔尔！ - 艾莉\N{\fs50}- Joel! - Ellie.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.78,0:24:10.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 艾莉！ - 乔尔！\N{\fs50}- Ellie! - Joel!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.23,0:24:45.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到火萤\N{\fs50}Welcome to the Fireflies.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.10,0:24:46.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,放松\N{\fs50}Easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.15,0:24:48.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你那一下挨得不轻\N{\fs50}Ya got hit pretty hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.03,0:24:51.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,巡逻的人不认识你\N{\fs50}Patrol didn't know who you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.70,0:24:56.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 艾莉在哪儿？ - 她没受伤\N{\fs50}- Where's Ellie? - She wasn't hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.91,0:24:58.53,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,一点都没有\N{\fs50}Not even a scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.53,0:25:00.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她主要担心的是你\N{\fs50}She's mostly worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.50,0:25:04.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她在哪儿？\N{\fs50}Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.41,0:25:07.21,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们在横穿全国的路上 失去了一半人手\N{\fs50}We lost half our crew crossing the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.21,0:25:09.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我有五个人专职保护我\N{\fs50}I had five men whose only job was to protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.25,0:25:11.42,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但我还是差点死掉\N{\fs50}I still almost got killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.42,0:25:13.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你是怎么做到的？\N{\fs50}How'd you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.26,0:25:16.26,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,都靠她\N{\fs50}It was all her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.26,0:25:17.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她拼死拼活才来到这儿\N{\fs50}She fought like hell to get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.64,0:25:19.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没有你 她第一天就得死\N{\fs50}She would've been dead on day one.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.14,0:25:25.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你是我最不想欠人情债的人\N{\fs50}You are the one person I never wanted to be in debt to.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.19,0:25:27.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但我欠你的\N{\fs50}But I owe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.77,0:25:28.71,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们都欠你的\N{\fs50}We all owe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.71,0:25:30.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,带我去见她\N{\fs50}Just take me to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.02,0:25:32.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不可能\N{\fs50}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.36,0:25:34.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她正准备动手术\N{\fs50}She's being prepped for surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.28,0:25:38.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,什么手术？\N{\fs50}What surgery?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.91,0:25:42.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们的医生\N{\fs50}Our doctor
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.25,0:25:45.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他认为艾莉体内的虫草菌 自她出生起就和她一同生长\N{\fs50}he thinks that the Cordyceps in Ellie has grown with her since birth.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.77,0:25:46.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她为什么要动手术？\N{\fs50}Why is she in surgery?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.87,0:25:49.50,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,它会产生一种化学信息\N{\fs50}It produces a kind of chemical messenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.50,0:25:52.13,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,让普通的虫草菌觉得她也属于虫草菌\N{\fs50}It makes normal Cordyceps think that she's Cordyceps.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.13,0:25:53.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以她才免疫\N{\fs50}It's why she's immune.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.92,0:25:55.59,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他准备把它从她体内切除\N{\fs50}He's gonna remove it from her,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.59,0:25:57.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,在实验室里繁殖细胞\N{\fs50}multiply the cells in a lab,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.51,0:26:00.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,生产这些化学信息素\N{\fs50}produce those chemical messengers
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.85,0:26:02.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,然后我们可以让所有人都拥有它\N{\fs50}and then we can give it to everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.27,0:26:06.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他认为这可能会是特效药 乔尔\N{\fs50}He thinks it could be a cure, Joel.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.60,0:26:07.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,特效药啊\N{\fs50}A cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.65,0:26:16.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,可虫草菌生长在大脑里\N{\fs50}Cordyceps grows inside the brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.61,0:26:20.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fs50}It does.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.70,0:26:26.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,找别人\N{\fs50}Find someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.60,0:26:27.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没有别人了\N{\fs50}There is no one else.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.75,0:26:30.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们没告诉她 也没有让她害怕\N{\fs50}We didn't tell her, we didn't cause her any fear,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.63,0:26:31.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,整个过程都是无痛的\N{\fs50}there won't be any pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.98,0:26:34.00,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不行 不行 你带我去见她 现在就带我去！\N{\fs50}No. No, you take me to her. You take me to her right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.76,0:26:45.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,求你了 你不明白\N{\fs50}Please, you don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.48,0:26:49.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fs50}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.23,0:26:53.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她出生的时候我在场 乔尔\N{\fs50}I was there when she was born, Joel.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.82,0:26:56.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我对她的母亲发誓 我会救下她的孩子\N{\fs50}I promised her mother that I would save her child.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.28,0:26:57.90,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我发了誓\N{\fs50}I promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.24,0:27:01.16,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,所以我明白\N{\fs50}So I do understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.95,0:27:04.28,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,只有我才明白\N{\fs50}I'm the only one who understands.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.91,0:27:11.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fs50}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.92,0:27:14.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我没有别的选择\N{\fs50}I have no other choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.21,0:27:19.34,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我有\N{\fs50}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.06,0:27:32.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,带他去高速路那儿 把他和他的包一起留那儿\N{\fs50}Walk him out to the highway, leave him there with his pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.31,0:27:33.52,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,把这个留给他\N{\fs50}Give him this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.32,0:27:39.07,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他要是有什么举动\N{\fs50}He tries anything
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.74,0:27:40.78,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,毙了他\N{\fs50}shoot him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.11,0:28:24.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我可没听见谁说“停下”\N{\fs50}I didn't hear anyone say, "Stop."
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.07,0:28:27.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,往哪儿走？\N{\fs50}Which way?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.24,0:28:28.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,走楼梯下去\N{\fs50}Down the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.81,0:28:56.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你他妈在干嘛？继续走\N{\fs50}The fuck are you doin'? Keep walking.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.69,0:28:59.02,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我说继续走——\N{\fs50}I said keep walk--
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.90,0:29:05.86,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 操！ - 她人在哪儿？\N{\fs50}- Fuck! - Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.49,0:29:08.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,去你妈的\N{\fs50}Fuck you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.74,0:29:09.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我没这个时间\N{\fs50}I don't have time for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.54,0:29:13.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,（有枪声 有枪声！）\N{\fs50}{\i1}Shots fired. Shots fired!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.00,0:32:05.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们电力够吗？\N{\fs50}Do we have enough power?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.26,0:32:11.26,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她准备好了\N{\fs50}She's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.26,0:32:16.60,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,解开她\N{\fs50}Unhook her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.51,0:32:18.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你怎么进来的\N{\fs50}How did you get in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.58,0:32:20.06,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我说 解开她\N{\fs50}I said unhook her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.93,0:32:22.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不会让你带她走\N{\fs50}I won't let you take her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.02,0:32:24.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,解开她\N{\fs50}Unhook her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.65,0:32:28.40,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 快点！ - 我的天啊\N{\fs50}- Move! - Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.24,0:32:33.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,给她包一下手臂\N{\fs50}Cover her arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.91,0:32:35.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 快点 - 好\N{\fs50}- Fast. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.66,0:32:40.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,转身\N{\fs50}Turn around.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.69,0:33:51.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你保护不了她一辈子\N{\fs50}You can't keep her safe forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.74,0:33:56.70,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,无论你多努力\N{\fs50}No matter how hard you try,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.70,0:33:58.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,无论你杀多少人\N{\fs50}no matter how many people you kill,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.24,0:34:00.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她都会长大的 乔尔\N{\fs50}she's gonna grow up, Joel.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.24,0:34:02.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,然后你会死 她会离开\N{\fs50}And then you'll die. She'll leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.74,0:34:04.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,然后呢？\N{\fs50}Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.04,0:34:07.83,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,用不了多久 她就会被感染者大卸八块 或者被强盗杀死\N{\fs50}How long till she's torn apart by Infected or murdered by raiders?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.83,0:34:11.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,因为她活在一个 你本可以拯救的末日世界里\N{\fs50}Because she lives in a broken world that you could have saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.17,0:34:12.17,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fs50}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.96,0:34:14.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但这不由你决定\N{\fs50}But it isn't for you to decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.69,0:34:15.88,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,也不由你\N{\fs50}Or you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.38,0:34:20.14,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那么她会怎么决定？\N{\fs50}So what would she decide?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.43,0:34:23.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,因为我觉得她会做正确的事\N{\fs50}'Cause I think she'd wanna do what's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.19,0:34:30.10,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而你知道这一点\N{\fs50}And you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.28,0:34:35.57,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还不算晚\N{\fs50}It's not too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.57,0:34:37.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,即使是现在\N{\fs50}Even now,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.03,0:34:39.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,即使你已经做了这些事\N{\fs50}even after what you've done.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.82,0:34:41.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们还是能找到方法\N{\fs50}We can still find a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.91,0:35:25.45,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 咋了？ - 没事 我在这儿\N{\fs50}- What? - It's all right. You're with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.29,0:35:27.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,悠着点\N{\fs50}Take it slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.58,0:35:30.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,药效还没完全过去\N{\fs50}The drugs are still wearin' off.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.62,0:35:33.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我本来在火萤那儿 然后——\N{\fs50}I was with the Fireflies and then--
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.55,0:35:36.96,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,什么药？\N{\fs50}What drugs?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.05,0:35:40.80,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们在你身上做测试\N{\fs50}They were runnin' some tests on you,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.47,0:35:44.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不止是你\N{\fs50}{\i1}and some others.{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.76,0:35:49.31,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,原来你这样的人还有很多\N{\fs50}Turns out there's a whole lot more like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.93,0:35:51.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,免疫的人\N{\fs50}People that are immune.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.35,0:35:53.69,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有几十个\N{\fs50}Dozens of 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.82,0:35:59.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而那些医生 他们找不到办法\N{\fs50}And the doctors, they couldn't make any of it work.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.99,0:36:02.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们其实已经——\N{\fs50}They've actually--
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.12,0:36:09.25,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,他们已经放弃寻找特效药了\N{\fs50}They've stopped lookin' for a cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.25,0:36:16.79,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我的衣服呢？\N{\fs50}Where are my clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.71,0:36:22.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有强盗袭击了医院 我差点没把你救出来\N{\fs50}Raiders attacked the hospital. I barely got ya outta there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.55,0:36:24.30,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,等在路上给你找些新衣服\N{\fs50}We'll find you some new ones on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.47,0:36:29.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有人受伤吗？\N{\fs50}Were people hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.73,0:36:34.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,有\N{\fs50}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.86,0:36:41.49,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,玛琳还好吗？\N{\fs50}Is Marlene okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.99,0:36:51.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们回家吧\N{\fs50}I'm takin' us home.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.18,0:37:10.39,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fs50}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.33,0:37:39.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不要 等等 等等\N{\fs50}No, wait. Wait, wait, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.54,0:37:41.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fs50}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.88,0:37:44.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,放过我吧\N{\fs50}Let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.55,0:37:47.47,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你只会对她穷追不舍\N{\fs50}You'd just come after her.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.72,0:38:36.73,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯 这车已经尽力了\N{\fs50}Well, she got us close enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.82,0:38:44.94,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,剩下的路得靠走的\N{\fs50}We gotta walk the rest of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.82,0:38:48.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,大概要步行五小时\N{\fs50}Probably about a five-hour hike
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.20,0:38:50.03,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但我们没问题的\N{\fs50}but we can manage that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.24,0:38:52.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还记得吗？\N{\fs50}Remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.83,0:38:54.74,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fs50}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.84,0:39:06.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你知道吗 莎拉和我以前常常像这样远足\N{\fs50}You know, Sarah and I used to hike like this all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.30,0:39:11.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,应该不是她最喜欢的活动\N{\fs50}I wouldn't say it was her favorite thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.68,0:39:15.01,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她讨厌蚊子啊啥的\N{\fs50}She wasn't a fan of the mosquitoes and such.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.01,0:39:18.64,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但她很喜欢爬山 或者说蹦着跑\N{\fs50}But she was a big climber, or scampering.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.35,0:39:21.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这么说可能准确点\N{\fs50}That's probably the right word.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.81,0:39:23.27,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,那姑娘\N{\fs50}That girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.27,0:39:25.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她看见块大石头 就会……\N{\fs50}she'd see a big rock, and just...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.94,0:39:29.82,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她会喜欢你的\N{\fs50}She woulda liked you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.82,0:39:32.66,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,不是说你俩很像\N{\fs50}Not to say the two of you are the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.57,0:39:36.04,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 你俩很不一样 - 怎么不一样了？\N{\fs50}- Definitely different kids. - How so?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.33,0:39:40.58,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,怎么说呢 她要更 我想说 女孩子气一点\N{\fs50}Well, she was a lot more, I wanna say girly.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.58,0:39:42.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我不是说你不女孩子气\N{\fs50}And I'm not sayin' that you're not girly.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.23,0:39:43.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我确实不\N{\fs50}I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.46,0:39:47.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯 是\N{\fs50}Yeah, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.63,0:39:49.63,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,这是一处不同\N{\fs50}So that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.13,0:39:51.68,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还有 她比你高\N{\fs50}She was taller.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.09,0:39:54.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她笑起来很可爱\N{\fs50}She had a killer smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.76,0:39:56.76,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,还是那句话 不是说你笑起来不可爱\N{\fs50}Again, not sayin' that you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.81,0:39:59.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但你知道我为啥觉得她会喜欢你吗？\N{\fs50}But you know why I think she'd like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.77,0:40:01.19,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fs50}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.19,0:40:02.81,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,因为你很幽默\N{\fs50}'Cause you're funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.31,0:40:07.23,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我觉得你会逗她笑\N{\fs50}I think you would've made her laugh.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.07,0:40:13.20,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,总之 我敢说你也会喜欢她\N{\fs50}Anyway, I bet you would've liked her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.32,0:40:16.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嗯 我也觉得\N{\fs50}Yeah, bet I would've.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.09,0:40:35.43,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你瞧瞧\N{\fs50}There ya go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.85,0:40:41.77,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,没多远了\N{\fs50}Not much further now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.85,0:40:43.98,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,嘿 等等\N{\fs50}Hey, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.77,0:40:49.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,妈的\N{\fs50}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.20,0:41:00.91,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,在堪萨斯城的时候 你问我第一次杀人的事\N{\fs50}Back in Kansas City, you asked me about the first time I killed someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.25,0:41:10.05,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我在商场里被咬的时候 我不是一个人\N{\fs50}When I got bit in the mall, I wasn't on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.05,0:41:13.34,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我最好的朋友也在场 她也被咬了\N{\fs50}My best friend was there and she got bit, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.55,0:41:16.84,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我们不知道该怎么办 然后她就说\N{\fs50}We didn't know what to do, and she says,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.84,0:41:18.85,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,“我们可以就这么等着\N{\fs50}"We can just wait it out,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.81,0:41:22.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,说不定一起失去理智也可以很诗意”\N{\fs50}be all poetic and just lose our minds together."
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.02,0:41:25.35,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,之后她发病了\N{\fs50}And then she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.27,0:41:27.61,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而我不得不——\N{\fs50}And I had to--
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.94,0:41:33.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她的名字叫莱莉\N{\fs50}Her name was Riley
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.11,0:41:35.11,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,她是第一个因我而死的人\N{\fs50}and she was the first to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.11,0:41:36.36,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,然后是泰丝\N{\fs50}And then it was Tess.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.36,0:41:37.87,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 然后是山姆 - 这都不怪你\N{\fs50}- And then Sam. - That's not on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.87,0:41:38.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我知道 但是——\N{\fs50}I know, but--
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.51,0:41:39.24,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,听着 有时候\N{\fs50}Look, sometimes things
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.24,0:41:41.29,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,事情的发展方向和我们希望的不一样\N{\fs50}don't work out the way we hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.29,0:41:42.75,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你也许觉得\N{\fs50}You can feel like
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.70,0:41:45.62,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你已经走到头了\N{\fs50}like you've come to an end
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.42,0:41:48.33,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,而你不知道接下来该怎么办\N{\fs50}and you don't know what to do next.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.46,0:41:52.38,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,但如果你继续向前\N{\fs50}But if you just keep goin'
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.34,0:41:56.51,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,你就能找到值得为之奋斗的目标\N{\fs50}you find something new to fight for.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.51,0:41:59.22,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,- 也许这不是——  - 向我发誓\N{\fs50}- And maybe that's not what-- - Swear to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.39,0:42:04.93,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,向我发誓 你说过有关火萤的一切都是真的\N{\fs50}Swear to me that everything you said about the Fireflies is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.52,0:42:10.65,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,我发誓\N{\fs50}I swear.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.16,0:42:27.41,Subtitle-TLOU,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fs50}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.50,0:00:06.20,Info-TLOU,,0,0,0,,{\fs80\t(\fs85.545)\b1\fad(500,1000)\pos(960,935.644)}HBO原创连续剧\N衣柜字幕组翻译制作
